      "id": "7706217618197335310",
      "text": "How people actually make money with AI right now: 5 honest ways (and where to start)\n\nHow to make money with AI, the honest version: the five ways people are really making money with AI right now, who each one is for, the catch, and which one to start with.\n\n1. AI consulting: business owners know they need AI and don't know where to start, so they pay someone to look at how the business runs, put AI in the right places, and build it. The catch: if you can't build it yet, don't sell it yet.\n2. The builder: build one AI system that fixes one problem, like answering every new lead in two minutes, and install it for business after business. Setup fee, then a monthly fee. The catch: keep it one system with small changes, or twenty clients turns into twenty different jobs.\n3. The freelancer: keep selling the skill you already have (writing, design, bookkeeping, video editing) and let AI do the first draft and the boring parts, so you deliver faster and take on more clients. The catch: your name is on it, so check everything.\n4. A digital product plus an AI content system (for people who aren't technical): turn what you already know from your own work into a product, like a bookkeeper's month-end checklist or a salon owner's pricing playbook. Film one tip a week, and let AI turn it into a week of posts and emails that point back at the product. The product takes a weekend. Getting found takes months.\n5. AI at your job (the one to start with): time a task that eats your week, automate it with AI, time it again, and write both numbers down. Do three tasks, bring one before/after sheet to your boss, and offer the same for other teams. That's how people get the new title and the raise: they become the AI person on the team.\n\nHow they connect: after a few months at your job you have real builds, real numbers and real proof, and the business down the road has the exact same problem. Sell them the build (consulting) or install it for every business like them (the builder). AI even helps you find them by scanning local business websites and drafting the first message for you.\n\nStart with one, get good at it, make money, then add the second.\n\nIf you don't know how to build any of this yet, I teach it step by step, from complete beginner to real AI systems you can use at work or sell. Check my profile.\n\n#aiautomation #aiconsulting #aiagent #learnai",
